plants. Lines males, testers (parents), males \eqn{\times}{x} testers and error, all tested against the error, with
\eqn{E(MS_m) = \sigma^2 + 2B\sigma^2_m}{E(MS_m) = sigma^2 + 2B sigma^2_m} and \eqn{E(MS_{mt}) = \sigma^2 +
